<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Constraints not visible in the boxes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• enrollments: unique (user_id, course_id)&lt;br&gt;• course_sections: unique (course_id, code); enrollments.section_id must belong to the same course&lt;br&gt;• submissions: unique (assignment_id, student_id, attempt_number); rows are never updated except status&lt;br&gt;• criterion_scores: unique (submission_id, criterion_id)&lt;br&gt;• test_results: unique (submission_id, test_case_id)&lt;br&gt;• skill_progress: unique (user_id, skill_id) · user_achievements: unique (user_id, achievement_id)&lt;br&gt;• feedback: one per submission (submission_id unique)&lt;br&gt;• Level is derived from SUM(xp_events.amount), not stored" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bdb76b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1346" width="640" height="166" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
